<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-165.2-project-registration-bonding-and-statutory-contractor-compliance" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4825" name="W4825. PCAB Project Registration per Contract &amp; Notice-of-Award Filing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Notice of Award / contract execution for an in-scope licensed project (B2G, B2B project, design-build VS-66)
Frequency: Per project contract
Volume: ~B2G + project contracts requiring registration per year (subset of B2G/project pipeline VS-46/VS-11)
Owner: PCAB Compliance Lead / Project Sales (VS-11.2) / Legal (VS-100.3)
Participants: Trade Sales, Finance (VS-40 project accounting), Insurance/Bond (VS-116), CIAP/PCAB
Source: workflow W4825 — PCAB Project Registration per Contract &amp; Notice-of-Award Filing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4825_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4825_Lane1" name="PCAB Compliance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4825_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4825_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4825_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4825_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4825_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4825_Start3" name="Notice of Award / contract execution for an in-scope licensed project (B2G, B2B project…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4825_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4825_Task4" name="On Notice of Award/contract execution, confirm the project is in licensed scope…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: On Notice of Award/contract execution, confirm the project is in licensed scope (W4836), the license category covers the contract value (W4819/W4828), and the license is current (W4820); capture project data (owner, location, scope, contract value, duration, category-applicability)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Trade Sales / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4825_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4825_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4825_Task5" name="File the PCAB-required project registration per the contract/notice of award…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: File the PCAB-required project registration per the contract/notice of award within the prescribed period (register the project against the entity license), pay any per-project registration fee, and manage the acknowledgment/certificate; coordinate bonds (W4826) and the safety program (W4827)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Legal / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4825_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4825_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4825_Task6" name="Record the registration in the compliance audit trail (W4823) and the project…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Record the registration in the compliance audit trail (W4823) and the project accounting/contract records (VS-40/VS-11/VS-100.3); set project-milestone/warranty obligations (W4830) and closeout (W4832)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Finance / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4825_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4825_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4825_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4825_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4825_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-726 (ensure controlled execution — Project Registration, Bonding &amp; Statutory Contractor Compliance (PA-165.2).) | - CTL-726: every in-scope contract project-registered before work start; capacity pre-checked; recorded in audit trail
Owner: PCAB Compliance Lead / Project Sales (VS-11.2) / Legal (VS-100.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4825_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4825_Annotation8" targetRef="W4825_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4825_Flow10" sourceRef="W4825_Start3" targetRef="W4825_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4825_Flow11" sourceRef="W4825_Task4" targetRef="W4825_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4825_Flow12" sourceRef="W4825_Task5" targetRef="W4825_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4825_Flow13" sourceRef="W4825_Task6" targetRef="W4825_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4825_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4825_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4825">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4825_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4825_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
