    <bpmn:process id="W_W4828" name="W4828. Bidding/Bid-Support License Proof, Capacity Pre-Check &amp; PhilGEPS Eligibility Sync" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Bid/no-bid decision (VS-46/VS-11.2); B2G eligibility-document refresh; annual PhilGEPS sync
Frequency: Per bid + annual
Volume: ~20–30 government/large-B2B bids per year requiring license proof
Owner: Trade Sales (VS-11.2) / Government Sales (VS-46) / PCAB Compliance Lead
Participants: Legal (VS-100.3), Finance (capacity), Surety (VS-116 bond)
Source: workflow W4828 — Bidding/Bid-Support License Proof, Capacity Pre-Check &amp; PhilGEPS Eligibility Sync</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4828_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4828_Lane1" name="Trade Sales">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4828_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4828_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4828_Lane2" name="PCAB Compliance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4828_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4828_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4828_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4828_Start4" name="Bid/no-bid decision (VS-46/VS-11.2); B2G eligibility-document refresh; annual PhilGEPS…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4828_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4828_Task5" name="At bid/no-bid, confirm BuildRight&#x27;s license is current (W4820), the project is…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: At bid/no-bid, confirm BuildRight&#x27;s license is current (W4820), the project is in licensed scope (W4836), and the license category/size covers the bid value (capacity pre-check W4819); if not, decide upgrade (W4819), JV/partner (W4837), or no-bid
Responsible (R): Trade Sales / Government Sales / PCAB Compliance Lead
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / VP Merchandising
Duration: Per bid</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4828_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4828_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4828_Task6" name="Produce bid-support license proof: current PCAB Certificate of Registration…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Produce bid-support license proof: current PCAB Certificate of Registration, category documentation, and the eligibility pack (PhilGEPS W162, mayor&#x27;s permit, BIR tax clearance, audited FS, Omnibus Sworn Statement); sync to PhilGEPS profile (VS-46.1) so it is current for every bid
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Legal / Government Sales
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per bid + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4828_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4828_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4828_Task7" name="On award (W4825), confirm the license-under-which the work will be performed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: On award (W4825), confirm the license-under-which the work will be performed and the entity (W4822); on loss, capture license-related bid-loss learnings to analytics (W4839)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Trade Sales
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per bid</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4828_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4828_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4828_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4828_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4828_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-726 (ensure controlled execution — Project Registration, Bonding &amp; Statutory Contractor Compliance (PA-165.2).) | - CTL-726: license current + capacity covers bid value before submission; eligibility pack current in PhilGEPS
Owner: Trade Sales (VS-11.2) / Government Sales (VS-46) / PCAB Compliance Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
