Frequency: Per subcontract + list maintenance
Volume: ~10–20 subcontractors used on licensed projects per year
Owner: PCAB Compliance Lead / Trade Sales (VS-11) / Procurement (VS-03/VS-34)
Participants: Legal (VS-100.3), HSE (VS-24), TPRM (VS-161), Subcontractors
Source: workflow W4829 — Subcontractor License Verification, Approved-Subcontractor List &amp; Cascading Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
