      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4829_Start3" name="Subcontracting part of a licensed project; approved-subcontractor refresh; subcontractor…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4829_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4829_Task4" name="Maintain the approved-subcontractor list for licensed work: verify each…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the approved-subcontractor list for licensed work: verify each subcontractor holds the required PCAB license/category for the subcontracted scope (the cascading-license obligation), PRC personnel, insurance, HSE program (VS-24), and TPRM (VS-161); pre-qualify via Procurement/Legal
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Procurement / Legal / TPRM
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous + per onboarding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4829_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4829_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4829_Task5" name="Per subcontract, verify the subcontractor&#x27;s license is current and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Per subcontract, verify the subcontractor&#x27;s license is current and category-covers the subcontract scope, execute the subcontract (with license-flow-down, safety W4827, payment W4831, warranty W4830 clauses), and notify the owner/PCAB where the contract requires subcontractor disclosure
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Legal / Trade Sales
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per subcontract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4829_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4829_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4829_Task6" name="Monitor subcontractor performance/compliance during the work (safety, quality…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Monitor subcontractor performance/compliance during the work (safety, quality, license currency), manage any subcontractor lapse/default (replace with continuity), and feed subcontractor record to analytics (W4839) and TPRM (VS-161)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Trade Sales / TPRM
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4829_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4829_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4829_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4829_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
