    <bpmn:process id="W_W4830" name="W4830. Project Warranty Period, Acceptance Certificate &amp; Retention/Maintenance Obligations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Project completion/substantial completion; acceptance; warranty period; retention release
Frequency: Per project (completion + warranty tail)
Volume: All licensed projects (completion + warranty tail)
Owner: Project Sales (VS-11) / PCAB Compliance Lead / Installation (VS-12)
Participants: Owner/customer, Finance (retention VS-40), Surety (VS-116 bond release), Legal (VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W4830 — Project Warranty Period, Acceptance Certificate &amp; Retention/Maintenance Obligations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4830_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4830_Lane1" name="Trade Sales">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4830_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4830_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4830_Lane2" name="PCAB Compliance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4830_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4830_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4830_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4830_Start4" name="Project completion/substantial completion; acceptance; warranty period; retention release">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4830_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4830_Task5" name="Manage project completion &amp; acceptance: punch-list/defect-snag resolution, the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Manage project completion &amp; acceptance: punch-list/defect-snag resolution, the owner&#x27;s acceptance certificate, and substantial-completion; document per the contract (VS-100.3) and project accounting (VS-11/VS-40)
Responsible (R): Trade Sales / Installation / PCAB Compliance Lead
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4830_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4830_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4830_Task6" name="Track the warranty/retention period: the PCAB/contract warranty obligation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Track the warranty/retention period: the PCAB/contract warranty obligation, retention money (VS-11 W165/W1134), and the warranty bond (W4826); respond to warranty/defect claims during the period with remediation (VS-12)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Installation / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / CFO
Duration: Per project (warranty tail)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4830_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4830_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4830_Task7" name="At warranty expiry/retention release: obtain final acceptance, release…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: At warranty expiry/retention release: obtain final acceptance, release retention (VS-11 W1134) and the warranty bond (W4826), close the project-registration in the audit trail (W4823), and complete statutory closeout for B2G (W4832)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Finance / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / CFO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4830_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4830_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4830_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4830_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4830_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-726 (ensure controlled execution — Project Registration, Bonding &amp; Statutory Contractor Compliance (PA-165.2).) | - CTL-726: acceptance documented; warranty/retention tracked; retention &amp; bond released at expiry; project-registration closed
Owner: Project Sales (VS-11) / PCAB Compliance Lead / Installation (VS-12)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
