    <bpmn:process id="W_W4831" name="W4831. Construction Payment Security — Mechanic&#x27;s-Lien Rights, Lien Waivers &amp; Payment-Bond Claims" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Project progress billing (VS-11); payment receipt; non-payment/default; owner/lender request for lien waiver
Frequency: Per billing milestone + on payment event
Volume: All licensed project payment milestones
Owner: PCAB Compliance Lead / AR (VS-16) / Legal (VS-100.3)
Participants: Finance (VS-16 AR, VS-40 project), Surety (VS-116 payment bond), Owner/GC, Subcontractors (W4829)
Source: workflow W4831 — Construction Payment Security — Mechanic&#x27;s-Lien Rights, Lien Waivers &amp; Payment-Bond Claims</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4831_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4831_Lane1" name="PCAB Compliance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4831_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4831_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4831_Lane2" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4831_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4831_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4831_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4831_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4831_Start5" name="Project progress billing (VS-11); payment receipt; non-payment/default; owner/lender…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4831_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4831_Task6" name="Manage lien rights &amp; waivers across the project: on each progress billing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Manage lien rights &amp; waivers across the project: on each progress billing, provide the conditional/unconditional lien waiver (per Civil Code contract practice / PD 1529 adverse-claim registration) upon payment, and preserve lien rights for unpaid scope; coordinate with AR (VS-16) and the project accounting (VS-11/VS-40)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / AR / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / CFO
Duration: Per milestone</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4831_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4831_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4831_Task7" name="On non-payment/default, assess remedies: mechanic&#x27;s-lien filing (within the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: On non-payment/default, assess remedies: mechanic&#x27;s-lien filing (within the statutory period on the improved property), payment-bond claim (on B2G/bonded work via VS-116), suspension/termination per contract, and escalation to collections/litigation (VS-16/VS-100); preserve evidence (W4823)
Responsible (R): Legal / AR / PCAB Compliance Lead / Treasury-Surety
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / CFO
Duration: Per default event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4831_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4831_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4831_Task8" name="Manage subcontractor/supplier payment cascade: ensure BuildRight&#x27;s…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage subcontractor/supplier payment cascade: ensure BuildRight&#x27;s subcontractors (W4829) are paid for work for which BuildRight has been paid (the payment-bond / cascading-payment obligation), collect their lien waivers, and avoid double-liability; report payment-security outcomes to analytics (W4839)
Responsible (R): Finance / PCAB Compliance Lead / Legal
Accountable (A): CFO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4831_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4831_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4831_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4831_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4831_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-726 (ensure controlled execution — Project Registration, Bonding &amp; Statutory Contractor Compliance (PA-165.2).) | - CTL-726: conditional-until-paid waiver discipline; lien rights tracked; subcontractor cascade reconciled; bond claims documented
Owner: PCAB Compliance Lead / AR (VS-16) / Legal (VS-100.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
