    <bpmn:process id="W_W4832" name="W4832. Government/Institutional Project Closeout, Audited Records &amp; Statutory Turnover" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Final acceptance (W4830); B2G project closeout; COA/agency audit; statutory turnover
Frequency: Per B2G/institutional project
Volume: ~B2G/institutional projects reaching closeout
Owner: Government Sales (VS-46) / PCAB Compliance Lead / Legal (VS-100.3)
Participants: Finance (VS-17/VS-40), Records (VS-88), Internal Audit (VS-21), Owner agency/COA
Source: workflow W4832 — Government/Institutional Project Closeout, Audited Records &amp; Statutory Turnover</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4832_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4832_Lane1" name="Government Sales">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4832_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4832_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4832_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4832_Lane2" name="PCAB Compliance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4832_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4832_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4832_Start4" name="Final acceptance (W4830); B2G project closeout; COA/agency audit; statutory turnover">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4832_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4832_Task5" name="Execute B2G/institutional closeout: final billing (VS-11), retention/bond…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Execute B2G/institutional closeout: final billing (VS-11), retention/bond release (W4826/W4830), as-built drawings/handover, acceptance certificate, and the agency&#x27;s commissioning/turnover; comply with RA 9184 closeout and any COA audit requirements
Responsible (R): Government Sales / PCAB Compliance Lead / Legal / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4832_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4832_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4832_Task6" name="Assemble the statutory turnover/audit-ready record set: contract + amendments…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Assemble the statutory turnover/audit-ready record set: contract + amendments, project-registration (W4825), bonds (W4826), safety records (W4827), waivers (W4831), acceptance/warranty (W4830), and financial reconciliation; retain per BIR/NIRC 10-year and COA rules (VS-88)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Records / Finance / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4832_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4832_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4832_Task7" name="Support any post-closeout COA/agency/PCAB audit or warranty claim (W4830), feed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Support any post-closeout COA/agency/PCAB audit or warranty claim (W4830), feed closeout performance (schedule, margin, defects, audit findings) to analytics (W4839) and bid learnings (VS-46), and update the project-registration/audit trail closure (W4823)
Responsible (R): Government Sales / PCAB Compliance Lead / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per project + on audit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4832_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4832_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4832_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4832_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4832_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-726 (ensure controlled execution — Project Registration, Bonding &amp; Statutory Contractor Compliance (PA-165.2).) | - CTL-726: complete closeout package; records retained per BIR/COA; closeout approved by VP Legal; audit-ready
Owner: Government Sales (VS-46) / PCAB Compliance Lead / Legal (VS-100.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
